<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= callType %> Call Scheduled</title>
    <style>
      /* General Styles */
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .email-container {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 0 0;
        max-width: 800px;
      }
      .header {
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        color: #4caf50;
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      .content {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .content p {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .content ul {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      .cta {
        margin-top: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .cta a {
        background-color: #4caf50;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .footer {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #777;
        text-align: left;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      /* Responsive Styles */
      @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .email-container {
          width: 100% !important;
          padding: 15px;
        }
        .header h1 {
          font-size: 20px;
        }
        .content p,
        .content ul {
          font-size: 14px;
        }
        .cta a {
          font-size: 14px;
          padding: 8px 16px;
        }
        .footer {
          font-size: 10px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hello <strong><%= userName %></strong>,</p>
        <p>
          Your Consultation call has been scheduled successfully. Please find
          the details below:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Date:</strong> <%= scheduledDate %></li>
          <li><strong>Time Slot:</strong> <%= consultTime %> IST</li>
          <li><strong>Counsellor's Name:</strong> <%= counsellorName %></li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <%= counsellorName %> shall call you on the above-mentioned date and
          time on the provided mobile number:
          <strong><%= userTel %></strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Alternatively, you can WhatsApp her at:
          <a href="https://wa.me/<%= counsellorPhone %>" target="_blank">
            <%= counsellorPhone %>
          </a>
        </p>
        <p>
          Also, take a look at the following link to know more about us:
          <a href="https://youtu.be/yZP7cpCcHSY" target="_blank">Click here </a
          >.
        </p>
      <p>P.S <b>Women Aren&rsquo;t Failing at Health The System Is -&nbsp;</b>Khyati Rupani breaks down why women don&rsquo;t need extreme diets, supplements, or food fads.&nbsp;<a href="https://youtu.be/raenYacbx40?si=VO78qWPFOSfah8yn">Click Here</a> </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; <%= year %> Balance Nutrition. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
